!--- SCENE ByTheLake :: A quiet evening, a stranger, and a choice ---

speaker narrator name="Narrator" color=#9a9a9a
speaker aria name="Aria" color=#ffcc66

say narrator "The wind rolls off the lake as the last light fades."
say narrator "Someone else is already at the fire — you weren't expecting company."
say aria "Didn't think anyone else knew this spot." wait=2000ms
say aria "Well. Sit, if you want."

choice aria "How do you answer?" {
  option "\"Thanks — mind if I stay a while?\"" signal=stayFriendly
  option "\"I was just leaving, actually.\"" signal=leaveCold
}

!---END---
